{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1787913371041,"sessionID":"ses_fb813b7dfffezqg7vX1LsD4l2m","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"task","callID":"task_0","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"subagent_type":"web-docs-agent","description":"Find and read latest PBOC report","prompt":"TASK: Find the LATEST quarterly 货币政策执行报告 (Monetary Policy Execution Report) published by 中国人民银行 (People's Bank of China, PBOC), read the official original page, and extract the key points.\n\nCONTEXT: The PBOC publishes quarterly 中国货币政策执行报告 on its official site (www.pbc.gov.cn), typically under 货币政策司 → 货币政策执行报告 column, or via 新闻/ publications. Today is 2026-08-28, so the most recent one should be the 2026 Q2 report (usually published mid-August 2026), or the 2026 Q1 report if Q2 is not yet out. Verify which is actually the latest.\n\nGOAL: A verified answer with (1) the exact report title (e.g., 《2026年第二季度中国货币政策执行报告》), (2) the official source URL on pbc.gov.cn (or other official government domain) that was actually read — not a media reprint, (3) publication date.\n\nREQUEST (deliverables):\n1. The exact title, publication date, and the official original page URL you actually fetched and read.\n2. A concise content digest of the report's main judgments (economic assessment, monetary policy stance/stance wording e.g. 稳健的货币政策 wording, key policy tools/directions mentioned, any notable data points like 社会融资规模/M2/credit figures cited).\n3. If the official page is a PDF, extract the text (OCR if needed) and base the digest on the actual document content, not media coverage.\n\nMUST DO: Base everything on the official original source actually read; cite the URL.\nMUST NOT DO: Do not rely solely on news articles summarizing the report; do not fabricate figures not present in the source."},"output":"<400> InternalError.Algo.InvalidParameter: Input file must be a valid PDF\n\nto continue: task(task_id=\"ses_fb81307deffenc4TGwCPs2E6b2\", load_skills=[], run_in_background=false, prompt=\"...\")","metadata":